And the only way to finish it off would be with the essential games list.

00:41:48.420 --> 00:41:51.260
WCW wrestling is, you know, which feels weird to just call it that.

00:41:51.400 --> 00:41:53.340
Like, uh, that's like a, you know, it's a whole show.

00:41:53.340 --> 00:41:57.220
I don't know. Like, I guess technically like if the fresh Prince of Bel Air had a video game, you would

00:41:57.220 --> 00:41:59.280
just call it the fresh Prince of Bel Air game, right?

