00:42:23.880 --> 00:42:25.080
It has a few problems.

00:42:25.280 --> 00:42:28.200
The slap fighting thing that I mentioned isn't the only problem in the game.

00:42:28.320 --> 00:42:33.740
Probably my biggest gripe with the game though, to be honest, but also because there's the

00:42:33.740 --> 00:42:38.860
ability to change your moves, but that the moves changing don't matter.

00:42:39.220 --> 00:42:42.200
You actually just would only pick the ones that you like.

