00:42:47.760 --> 00:42:49.980
Cause I haven't played with it the last three matches, right?

00:42:50.020 --> 00:42:51.100
Like you just don't do that.

00:42:51.100 --> 00:42:54.080
You're just going to pick the moves that you like, and you're going to do those things.

00:42:54.220 --> 00:42:55.960
And even if you did choose different moves, it wouldn't matter.

00:42:55.960 --> 00:42:57.500
The only thing that would change would be the animation.

00:42:58.100 --> 00:43:02.240
All that to say that they could have went a little deeper to get something like this

00:43:02.240 --> 00:43:03.120
on the essential games list.

