Cause I feel like it could have got there with a few more like, um, uh, not necessarily

00:43:10.400 --> 00:43:16.040
RPG like mechanics, but some more, um, differences between each wrestler.

00:43:16.040 --> 00:43:23.360
It's kind of weird that, uh, Ric Flair and sting are, are like on the same caliber for, for

