00:44:37.960 --> 00:44:40.100
Joe. I don't think this game is bad.

00:44:40.360 --> 00:44:43.820
Um, I guess you could even say that I, I would say that it's good.

00:44:44.060 --> 00:44:50.920
You know, I, I'm, I'm, I'm not opposed to that, but, uh, I have, I feel like unofficially

00:44:51.460 --> 00:44:54.320
become the multiplayer tester on games like this.

